      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## NYC general contractor contacts\nExport up to 20 businesses with an active NYC general contractor registration and an email in the city record. Each result includes its contact source. [Preview the Apify task](https://apify.com/perceptive_city_af7/houzz-professionals-scraper/examples/find-20-nyc-contractors-with-public-business-emails).\n\n1. In **Fetch NYC contractor contacts**, choose a **Header Auth** credential with header name `Authorization` and value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Click **Execute Workflow** once. The Free-plan result price is $0.029 for 20 businesses. The Actor charge limit is $0.03 per run, and zero matching results cost $0 in Actor charges.\n3. Open **Convert to CSV → Output → Binary → data** and download `nyc-contractor-emails.csv`. Automatic retries are off. If a request times out, check your Apify runs before starting it again.",
        "width": 770,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
